BEHAVIOR isub
DESCRIPTION
  Subtracts b from a (8-byte ints) and returns the difference. Pure helper so
  compositions can derive a length without computing inline.
CONTRACT
  INPUT a int 8
  INPUT b int 8
  OUTPUT diff int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output
HASH e54f8c17
IMPLEMENTATION
  va = LOAD a 8
  vb = LOAD b 8
  d = ISUB va vb 8
  STORE diff d 8
END
